(17633, 'HLTH', '427', 'Dementia Care', 'This course provides a comprehensive examination of dementia from multiple perspectives, including the person living with dementia, family care partners, and the health and social care systems. Key topics include epidemiology, prevention, stigma, meaningful engagement, care, and support.', 0.50, NULL),
