(19481, 'SPAN', '436W', 'Reading Across the Genre Divide (WLU)', 'Taught in Spanish. This seminar course focuses on works by major writers in Spanish. Through this course, students will form intertextual bridges over the genre divide that will encourage literary comparisons underlining the significance of each one. At the same time, the course will analyze critical works of the texts studied.', 0.50, NULL),
